## Why This Is Asked

This question assesses advanced memory management design skills, including compression-based memory optimization, cross-CPU synchronization mechanisms, quota enforcement strategies, and NUMA-aware data placement under memory pressure.

## Key Concepts

- Memory compression paths, per-CPU caches, and CAS-driven state machines
- Concurrency control using lock-free or fine-grained locking with TLB coherence
- NUMA-aware data placement, per-tenant quota accounting, and eviction policies

## Code Example

